        func run<M1: Cuckoo._Matchable>(_ p0: M1) -> Cuckoo.ProtocolStubNoReturnFunction<(() -> Void), ((@escaping () -> Void)) -> Void, Cuckoo.StubSharing.Confined> where M1.MatchedType == () -> Void {
            let matchers: [Cuckoo.ParameterMatcher<(() -> Void)>] = [Cuckoo.wrap(matchable: p0) {
                    $0
                }]
            return .init(stub: cuckoo_manager.createStub(for: MockClosureSpecifierService.self,
                method: "run(_ p0: sending () -> Void)",
                parameterMatchers: matchers
            ))
        }
    }

    nonisolated struct __VerificationProxy_ClosureSpecifierService: Cuckoo.VerificationProxy {
        private let cuckoo_manager: Cuckoo.MockManager
        private let cuckoo_callMatcher: Cuckoo.CallMatcher
        private let cuckoo_sourceLocation: Cuckoo.SourceLocation

        init(manager: Cuckoo.MockManager, callMatcher: Cuckoo.CallMatcher, sourceLocation: Cuckoo.SourceLocation) {
            self.cuckoo_manager = manager
